talk Guest@Merchant@Leave
{
	Well, that's all from me. Enjoy the rest of your party!
}

talk Guest@Merchant@Leave
{
	Looks like it's time for me to go. Pleasure doing business with you!
}

talk Guest@Merchant@Leave
{
	If you're packing up then I suppose I'll head on to the next party; they're sure to need my help!
}

