}


//———————————————————— Give cake (via Birthday Needle) ————————————————————
talk Guest@Merchant@GiveCake
{
	\i[10]A cake! How wonderful! Say, have you tried various kinds of sprinkles to decorate your cakes with?
	
	I actually have some with me, if you wanted to see them for yourself...
}

talk Guest@Merchant@GiveCake
{
	\i[10]Wow, that's quite an impressive cake! How much did such a thing cost you? I could cut you a good deal on something very similar...
}

talk Guest@Merchant@GiveCake
{
	\i[10]Amazing, what a splendid cake! Do you have a good supplier? I could set you up with an excellent wholesaler...
}